WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.000
A simple first week
Find the official Android listing at curaevita.com/from-youtube/. Check the actual price, trial eligibility and renewal date before subscribing.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Make one meal or symptom entry
Record a meal or digestive observation with its date and time.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Keep only useful details
Timing alone does not prove a food caused a symptom. Do not use the app to choose an elimination diet.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:48.000
Revisit your personal record
Explore history, then the PDF report control in Settings. Choose 30 days, 90 days or all history. Few entries mean a limited report.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Choose what you share
Preview a report before sharing it. For technical help, use curaevita.com/support/. Do not email a private diary or health details.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:12.000
Decide before renewal
£0.99/month per app in the UK after an eligible 7-day trial. Local prices vary. Renews unless cancelled in Google Play. Uninstalling does not cancel.
